WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:10,070
The little fox should be one of the nine-tailed sky foxes

2
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:11,670
Each additional tail grows

3
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:12,870
Trim your tail to make it longer

4
