11
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:35,340
Faster than lightning

12
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,340
Change of temper

13
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,540
Why don't you believe it?

14
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,340
